# Images (reference/components/image.md). Page area of 260 × 260 from (20, 20). The images in
# resources/images/test: wide.png of 200 × 100 pixels (150 × 75 pt, ratio 2), tall.jpg of
# 120 × 160 (90 × 120 pt, ratio 0.75) and square.png of 40 × 40 (30 × 30 pt).
#
# Page 1: title (12) and its margin of 8. hero, with Width: 100%, measures 260 × 130 (the ratio gives
# the height) and leaves another margin of 8: the Stack starts at 178. portrait has Height: 60, so its
# intrinsic width is 45; caption grows to 260 − 45 − 10 = 205 (41 characters per line: two
# lines) and stretches to the height of the row, 60. moved (60 × 80 with Width: 60) does not fit in what
# remains (280 − 246 = 34) and moves whole to page 2.
# Page 2: moved at 20, with its margin of 8. The grid has two columns of (260 − 10) / 2 = 125 and
# its images declare Height: 50, so they do not stretch vertically: the row measures 50 (with 80,
# its minimum width would be 160 and the columns would not fit). contain draws the 100 × 50 image
# centered in its box, over its background; cover draws it at 125 × 62.5 and crops it. The Markdown turns the lone
# image in its paragraph into an Image of its natural size (30 × 30); the paragraph goes below: md measures 30 + 12.
# logo: a Page overlay in the top right corner, in the page margin, on both pages.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Page:
		Width: 300
		Height: 300
		Margin: 20
	Title: Imágenes
	Language: es
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
	Section:
		Page overlay:
			Offset: -16 0 auto auto
			Image: test/square.png
				Id: logo
				Box:
					Width: 12
		Text: Imágenes
			Id: title
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 8 0
		Image: test/wide.png
			Id: hero
			Alt: Un paisaje con montañas y un sol
			Box:
				Width: 100%
				Margin: 0 0 8 0
		Stack:
			Id: row
			Gap: 10
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 8 0
			Item:
				Image: test/tall.jpg
					Id: portrait
					Alt: Un retrato
					Box:
						Height: 60
			Item:
				Grow: 1
				Text: Una foto en un Stack: su ancho sale de su alto y de la proporción del fichero.
					Id: caption
		Image: test/tall.jpg
			Id: moved
			Box:
				Width: 60
				Margin: 0 0 8 0
		Grid:
			Id: fits
			Column sizes: * *
			Gap: 10
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 8 0
			Area:
				Image: test/wide.png
					Id: contain
					Box:
						Height: 50
						Background: #E6E6E6
			Area:
				Image: test/wide.png
					Id: cover
					Fit: fill
					Box:
						Height: 50
		Markdown:
			Id: md
			Content >>
				![Logotipo](test/square.png)

				Texto después de la imagen.
